WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
(mellow electronic music)

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.260
- [Narrator] Welcome to London,
a city steeped in history

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.253
and known for its iconic landmarks.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.283
British cuisine might
not be world renowned,

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.680
but the city is full of great food

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.830
that extends way beyond
its classic fish and chips.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.450
First up, an American
classic with an Indian twist.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.873
A Londoner's favorite.

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:34.023
(mellow electronic music)

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:22.020
(laughing)

00:01:25.348 --> 00:01:27.830
- [Narrator] Next up, head
to the windy streets of Soho

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:29.610
and check out this small hole in the wall

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.039
serving up a traditional
Chinese breakfast dish.

00:01:32.039 --> 00:01:35.539
(mellow electronic music)

00:02:28.211 --> 00:02:30.220
- [Narrator] Tucked away
in a south London market

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:33.097
is a chip shop that isn't
always playing by the rules.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.080
- [Narrator] Back towards the city center

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.000
you'll find a Brazilian classic,

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.283
using an ingredient
we've never seen before.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.324
- [Narrator] And finally,

00:04:31.324 --> 00:04:33.460
for a twist on a traditional arepa,

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.110
there's only one place we
recommend for this one.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.037
It's this spot.

00:04:37.037 --> 00:04:40.537
(mellow electronic music)

00:05:40.443 --> 00:05:43.526
(electronic dinging)

